1. GRANT OF LICENSE
Ergctl is distributed in two tiers within the commercial binary build:

(a) Generous Free Core Tier (No License Key Required):
You are granted a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to install
and execute the Free Core features (`probe`, interactive raw-mode `tui`, manual
live `control` for `--watts`/`--speed`/`--incline`/`--resistance`/`--pause`/
`--resume`/`--stop`/`--reset` and `c2_set_sample_rate`, `workout validate`,
unidirectional `--json` telemetry `stream`, session `export` to JSON/CSV/TCX/FIT
over CLI or MCP, `restore`, `license status`, `--dry-run` previews, and
read-only/export/dry-run MCP tools) for personal, testing, or evaluation use.

(b) Pro Perpetual Tier (Valid Polar.sh License Key Required):
Upon purchase of a valid Ergctl Pro license key, Raymond de Oliveira grants
you a perpetual, non-exclusive, non-transferable license for one (1) named
individual to activate and use all Pro automation features (structured
`workout run` execution, bidirectional AI-coaching `stream --bidirectional`,
aerodynamic bike simulation `--grade`/`--wind-speed`/`--crr`/`--cw`, wheel
circumference/HR/spin-down/targeted-goal controls, Concept2 workout programming
& on-screen cues, and live mutating MCP hardware tools) on up to three (3)
personal macOS machines. Pro licenses operate offline after activation with
local `0600` key caching (14-day offline grace) and zero usage telemetry.

